          "default": "nullptr"
        }
      ],
      "returnType": "MeshIntersection::FIntersectionsQueryResult",
      "docs": "Compute all intersections between two meshes.\nTransformF argument transforms vertices of OtherTree to our tree (can be null if in same coord space)\nReturns pairs of intersecting triangles, which could intersect in either point or segment\nCurrently *does not* return coplanar intersections."
    },
